{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/21a326c83c220a83bab0bd519d88894f.avif?t=1746078175\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where am I\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you woke up, you found yourself in a strange place. According to a boy in the mirror, this place is Noroi Kago. He wants to help you leave, but a barrier prevents him from crossing to the other side. If the boy is going to rescue you, you\u2019ll need to crack the barrier first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you\u2019ll have to cooperate with your friends and companions, but\u2026 What else is hiding inside this barrier with you? Don\u2019t let the yokai find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/b16db2d5838fda6d2a29410cfc5afd1d.avif?t=1746078175\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For their own reasons, the yokai inside the barrier won\u2019t try to kill you immediately. Even if you are attacked once, your allies can help you recover and resume your escape. I dread to think of what would happen if you were alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/48d2cda3c426137a22e4d5438958ff41.avif?t=1746078175\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you linger inside the barrier, the more the unearthly aura of the space will erode your humanity, until you become something else. Hold onto your humanity while you make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4bc443204416ece992766553f375a7f967ed51f3.jpg","localized_name":"Return to Everyday Life","name":"Return to Everyday Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299060/4bc443204416ece992766553f375a7f967ed51f3.jpg"},{"icon":"2c1ae4c1f3a39cb39ac7d71a7610c6f4df392108.jpg","localized_name":"How do I survive...?","name":"How do I survive...?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299060/2c1ae4c1f3a39cb39ac7d71a7610c6f4df392108.jpg"},{"icon":"ac928156c3d9eb18fdc24274a658c98441e5a8ec.jpg","localized_name":"Bonds of Friendship","name":"Bonds of Friendship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299060/ac928156c3d9eb18fdc24274a658c98441e5a8ec.jpg"},{"icon":"24dfa9140e2b0b281f725a34c6e0c49d59501ed8.jpg","localized_name":"Lurkers in the Darkness","name":"Lurkers in the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299060/24dfa9140e2b0b281f725a34c6e0c49d59501ed8.jpg"},{"icon":"315b585689d1ecb266b02f7d2e2411469b3d7140.jpg","localized_name":"Kitaro's Arrival","name":"Kitaro's Arrival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299060/315b585689d1ecb266b02f7d2e2411469b3d7140.jpg"},{"icon":"ce668176d5b7ebe24b5161eb562bfa4b0383f370.jpg","localized_name":"I won't lose to some Yokai",